  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As-Samra WWTP Solar Pane</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this D2B-project is to finance and facilitate the development of a feasibility study (including environmental and social aspects) regarding the construction and operation of a solar power array that will produce electricity for the As Samra WWTP System.The ultimate goal is the construction of a solar power array that will produce enough electricity for the As Samra WWTP System to replace its current grid electricity consumption. Rough estimates by MWI and SPC indicate that the solar panels would need to have a capacity of around 25 MW and produce around 40 GWh on an annual basis.</narrative>
  </description>
